===Noun===
'''submariner'''

# A member of the [[crew]] of a [[submarine]].
#{{baseball}} A pitcher that throws with an underhand motion
#: ''Jones was a '''submariner''' and could often confuse a batter with his unorthodox delivery.''

Pronunciation: (crewman) accent is on the "I" (i.e. "submarine-er"); (baseball) accent is on the "A"

